# Préfecture pages moved from /prefectures/prefecture/{slug}/ to
# /prefectures/{slug}/ on 2026-10-16 to drop the doubled path segment
# (flagged in an external UX review). Real 301s so any link or search
# index entry pointing at the old URL keeps working rather than 404ing.
# Netlify and Cloudflare Pages/Workers both read this same file format.
/prefectures/prefecture/*  /prefectures/:splat  301
